description":"Co-production 50/50 split in favor of Blackeyed Theatre","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"2026: The Turn of the Screw","instanceDates":"11 September-10 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":"01-2026:107","id":"200893AHVSNHLHCSHVBGQBHBQHKTBCQGT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-09-11T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-09-11T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-10T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-10T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"01-2026:107","attribute_AgreedServiceChargeExclusion":false,"attribute_EventCopyLine":"2026: The Turn of the Screw","attribute_Genre":"Theatre","attribute_IncludeInFundingReport":false,"attribute_Location":"Studio 1","attribute_LongEventName":"2026: The Turn of the Screw","attribute_Festival":""},{"description":"","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":60,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"2026: The Ugly One","instanceDates":"17 November-19 December","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":"02-2026:210","id":"207293AQQMKNCNCLSDGTGGTRHGQVSLJGV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-17T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-17T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-19T18:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-19T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"02-2026:210","attribute_AgreedServiceChargeExclusion":false,"attribute_EventCopyLine":"2026: The Ugly One","attribute_Genre":"Theatre","attribute_IncludeInFundingReport":false,"attribute_Location":"Studio 2","attribute_LongEventName":"2026: The Ugly One","attribute_Festival":""},{"description":"50/50 Split\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nContent warnings include: Descriptions of a controlling relationship and attempted suicide\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nIn a deserted circus, drama, humour, music and songs tell the true story of actress Tilly Wedekind. When her controlling, famous husband, Frank Wedekind (writer of Spring Awakening which became an award-winning Broadway musical) robs Tilly of her acting roles he reduces her to a Nobody and, broken-hearted, she attempts suicide.  She fights to recover, reclaims her career and writes her own story to assert her own identity and become a Somebody. \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nDrawing on her own experience of being trapped in a coercive relationship, Bella Martin’s \r\ninternationally acclaimed, tour-de-force solo performance confronts vital questions around toxic relationships, co-dependency and the silencing of women's voices, to reflect on identity, love and the transformative power of self-discovery.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":75,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"2026: Tilly Nobody","instanceDates":"7 July-25 July","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":"02-2026:206","id":"204693AKJKPNDLDNJNRGNTDRBJKMVTMQM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-07-07T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-07-07T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-07-25T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-07-25T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"02-2026:206","attribute_AgreedServiceChargeExclusion":false,"attribute_EventCopyLine":"2026: Tilly Nobody","attribute_Genre":"Theatre","attribute_IncludeInFundingReport":false,"attribute_Location":"Studio 2","attribute_LongEventName":"2026: Tilly Nobody","attribute_Festival":""},{"description":"NEW VERSION, PLEASE BOOK THIS ONE\r\n\r\nArcola Theatre and Nick of Time Productions presents 14:30 MATINEES DUE TO SHOW LENGTH, THURS MATINEES IN FINAL TWO WEEKS SERIES OF SHORT PLAYS","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":160,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"2026: Ukraine Unbroken","instanceDates":"27 February-28 March","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":"01-2026:104","id":"200693AKGRJPKQCCPDQMMCKCSDRQPVRKG",